    <string name="onboarding_add_api_key">Add Gemini API key</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page1_title">Dub the world live</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page1_body">Play YouTube, podcasts, or any app. Voxora captures system audio and speaks a live translation in your language.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_title">Read any document aloud</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_body">Open Voxora Reader, pick a PDF or text file, and Voxora narrates it in the language you choose. The page shows that language too, and keeps playing in the background.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_title">Your privacy matters</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_body">Your key, your documents and your audio go only to Google\'s Gemini API — Voxora has no server of its own. Screen capture belongs to Live Dub alone; the Reader needs none. You can stop anytime from the app or the notification.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page4_title">Add your free Gemini key</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page4_body">Create a key in Google AI Studio and paste it in Settings. One key powers both Live Dub and the Reader, and it is stored on this device. Signing in with Google is optional — Voxora works as a guest.</string>
